==Battleground==
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hatsune Miku XVI (Enemy)|Hatsune Miku XVI]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~50 seconds<sup>600f~1,500f</sup>.
**12 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~8.33 seconds<sup>100f~250f</sup>.
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~8.33 seconds<sup>100f~250f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

